  index 24: C2/m (12), C2/c (15), Pnma (62), Cmcm (63), P4_2/nmc (137),
    Immm (71)
  index 48: Cmcm (63), P-1 (2), P2_1/m (11), C2/m (12), P2_1/c (14), Pmmn (59)
